<title>CANADA: Canada June natural gas production rises 5.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada June natural gas production rises 5.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Canada figures for crude oil and natural gas production and exports:</p>
<p>CRUDE OIL AND EQUIVALENT HYDROCARBONS (thousand cubic meters)</p>
<p>		   June 1995    June 1996	 pct</p>
<p>   Production   9,447.3	9,354.4	 -1.0</p>
<p>   Exports	5,434.8	5,628.1	  3.6</p>
<p>   Imports	2,686.0	3,143.0	 17.0</p>
<p>   Ref receipts 7,245.8	7,412.8	  2.3</p>
<p>NATURAL GAS (millions of cubic meters)</p>
<p>		   June 1995    June 1996	 pct</p>
<p>   Production  11,260.0     11,840.2	  5.2</p>
<p>   Exports	6,142.7	6,323.4	  2.9</p>
<p>   Canada sales 3,249.5	3,350.7	  3.1</p>
<p>CRUDE OIL (thousands of cubic meters)</p>
<p>		  Jan/June 1995 Jan/June 1996   pct</p>
<p>   Production     55,962.7   56,511.2	 1.0</p>
<p>   Exports	  30,039.0   31,613.7	 5.2</p>
<p>   Imports	  16,935.5   19,637.5	16.0</p>
<p>   Ref receipts   43,411.4   45,625.1	 5.1</p>
<p>NATURAL GAS (milions of Cubic meters)</p>
<p>   Production     74,585.7   76,324.4	 2.3</p>
<p>   Exports	  39,233.2   39,793.1	 1.4</p>
<p>   Canada sales   35,072.49  36,987.7	 5.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Canada sales include direct sales.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact David Roeske, Energy Section, (613) 951-3563.)</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745</p>
</text>
